msgid "   24 hours. After that it is installed at the next boot. lnd-update check shows where it is."
msgstr "   24 horas. Pasado ese plazo, se instala en el próximo arranque. lnd-update check muestra en qué punto está."

#: lnd-update.sh:247
msgid "   Installing in the background (lnd-update-wait); its progress:"
msgstr "   Instalando en segundo plano (lnd-update-wait); su progreso:"

#: lnd-update.sh:261
msgid "   Still busy, or it became unsafe meanwhile: lnd-update-wait goes on by itself (journalctl -u lnd-update-wait)."
msgstr "   Sigue ocupado, o entretanto dejó de ser seguro: lnd-update-wait continúa por sí solo (journalctl -u lnd-update-wait)."

#: lnd-update.sh:264
msgid "The update to %s didn't finish: journalctl -u lnd-update-wait, and %s"
msgstr "La actualización a %s no terminó: journalctl -u lnd-update-wait, y %s"

#: lnd-update.sh:282 serverb/serverb-update:281
msgid "⏸️ Still not safe after 24 hours: %s is installed at the next boot"
msgstr "⏸️ Sigue sin ser seguro después de 24 horas: %s se instalará en el próximo arranque"

