msgstr "La copia de resguardo no pasó la verificación: %s"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1047
msgid "✅ Safety backup stored and checked: %s/%s"
msgstr "✅ Copia de resguardo guardada y verificada: %s/%s"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1051
msgid "⚠️ Could not store the safety backup on the attached volume"
msgstr "⚠️ No se pudo guardar la copia de resguardo en el volumen adjunto"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1054
msgid "⚠️ The attached volume is not mounted, so the safety backup is not stored there"
msgstr "⚠️ El volumen adjunto no está montado, así que la copia de resguardo no se guarda allí"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1065
msgid "✅ Safety backup stored and checked on Server B: pre-recovery/%s"
msgstr "✅ Copia de resguardo guardada y verificada en el Servidor B: pre-recovery/%s"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1068
msgid "⚠️ Could not store the safety backup on Server B"
msgstr "⚠️ No se pudo guardar la copia de resguardo en el Servidor B"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1071
msgid "⚠️ Server B's backup gate can't be reached, so the safety backup is not stored there"
msgstr "⚠️ No hay conexión con la compuerta de copias del Servidor B, así que la copia de resguardo no se guarda allí"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1080
msgid "✅ Safety backup stored and checked on GitHub: pre-recovery/%s"
msgstr "✅ Copia de resguardo guardada y comprobada en GitHub: pre-recovery/%s"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1083
msgid "⚠️ Could not store the safety backup on GitHub"
msgstr "⚠️ No se pudo guardar la copia de resguardo en GitHub"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1089
msgid "The safety backup could not be stored anywhere. Nothing has been deleted."
msgstr "La copia de resguardo no se pudo guardar en ningún lugar. No se ha borrado nada."

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1098
msgid "a few minutes, plus the scan for old funds, which can take minutes to hours"
msgstr "unos minutos, más la búsqueda de fondos anteriores, que puede tardar de minutos a horas"

#: lnd-wallet.sh:1099
